"entity": {
"name": "Granges AB",
"description": "Gr\u00e4nges AB is an aluminium technology company, which develops lighter and more sustainable aluminium products and solutions. It operates through the following segments: Gr\u00e4nges Eurasia, Gr\u00e4nges Americas, and Other and Eliminations. The Gr\u00e4nges Eurasia segment offers heat exchanger materials for the automotive industry. The Gr\u00e4nges Americas segment provides rolled aluminium products for the heating, ventilation, and air conditioning (HVAC) industry. The Other and Eliminations segment manages group functions and other activities which cannot be allocated to the business areas. The company was founded on July 30, 1896 and is headquartered in Stockholm, Sweden.",
